    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 0,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "'Tis not my wish to unsettle everyone, so I\r\ncannot speak of it aloud...",
        "Jp" : "みなを不安にさせたくないので\r\nあまり大きな声では申し上げられませんが――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 515546,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 1,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "In truth, infected humans do exist— Through the\r\nworking of the infection, they no longer retain\r\naught of reason befitting a human.",
        "Jp" : "実は、侵食された人間が存在するのです――\r\n彼らは侵食の作用により、すでに人らしい\r\n理性はとどめておりません"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 544733,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "And thus... herein lies the turmoil—\r\nSome days past, Finbar of this village,\r\nwhilst walking outside,\r\nis said to have encountered the infected...",
        "Jp" : "そして、ここからが問題なのですが――\r\n先日、この村におりますフィンバーが\r\n外を歩いていたところ\r\n侵食された彼らと遭遇したそうでして――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 544734,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "No, 'twould be best to hear the details from the\r\nperson themself. Were I to relate it, 'twould\r\nbe naught but hearsay—",
        "Jp" : "いえ、これより詳しくは本人から\r\nお聞きになった方がよいでしょう\r\n私からでは又聞きとなってしまいますから――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 544736,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 2600,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Arthfael",
      "Jp" : "アルトフェイル"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 19266,
    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 4,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Ser Arisen, though it trouble you, speak\r\nquietly about this―\r\nFor the particulars, I would ask that you\r\nhear them from Finbar...",
        "Jp" : "覚者様、どうか小声でお願いいたします――\r\n詳しくはフィンバーよりお聞きください――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 515547,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 2600,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Arthfael",
      "Jp" : "アルトフェイル"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 19267,
    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 5,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "E-eek—\r\nThat... that tale...?\r\nI... I'd rather not recall it—",
        "Jp" : "ひ、ひぃ――\r\nあの話ですか――もう、思い出したくないのに――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 515548,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 6,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I... I've not left the village in ages, see...\r\nThought... this won't do... mustered\r\nwhat courage I could...\r\nWent out walking—",
        "Jp" : "僕、村から全然出なくなっちゃったもので\r\nこのままじゃいけないって勇気を振り絞って\r\n散歩に出たんです――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 544737,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 7,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Then, ere I knew it, I was near the\r\n<SPOT 941>.\r\nThat's when I saw it...",
        "Jp" : "そうしたらいつの間にか\r\n《<SPOT 941>》の近くまで行っちゃって\r\nそこで、見たんです――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 544738,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 8,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "The infected people... infected growths protruded\r\nfrom them, same as the monsters...\r\nthey staggered about...",
        "Jp" : "侵食された人たちのこと――\r\n魔物と同じく、侵食核が突き出ていて\r\nふらふら歩いてました"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 544739,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 9,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I fled in a panic... but they noticed me, and\r\ntried to give chase!\r\nI... I believe I was not followed, but...\r\nMayhap the village's location is known as well...",
        "Jp" : "慌てて逃げましたが、彼らは僕に\r\n気付いて追ってこようとしていました！\r\n跡はつけられていないつもりですが――\r\nもしかしたら、村の位置もばれてるかも――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 544740,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 10,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "S-Ser Arisen, I beseech you...\r\nIt pains me to say this, as a fellow human...\r\nBut... but, please... smite them...!",
        "Jp" : "か、覚者さん、お願いです\r\n同じ人としてこんなこと言うのも辛いんです\r\nでも――でも、彼らを討ってきてください――！"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 544741,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 11,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "If they should come to the village...\r\n'twould be undone— Pray, forgive me... they\r\nappeared as ordinary folk, until one drew nigh.\r\nI... I fear we would let them within the gates\r\nere we knew the truth.",
        "Jp" : "もしも彼らが村にやってきたら\r\nこの村は壊滅してしまいます――\r\nなんせ、近寄るまでは普通の人間に見えたんです\r\nきっと門の内側まで進入を許してしまうでしょう"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 544742,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 12,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "And then... pray, forgive me. Could you retrieve\r\nthe note I dropped yonder? By ill fortune, 'twas\r\none marking Morfaul's location—",
        "Jp" : "それから、僕があそこに落としてきてしまった\r\nメモの回収もお願いできないでしょうか？\r\n運の悪いことに、モルフォールの位置を記した\r\nメモだったんです――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 544743,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 13,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "There are other infected humans;\r\nshould they read it...\r\nI... I know no peace—\r\nPlease, prithee, I beseech you—!",
        "Jp" : "侵食された人間が他にもいて\r\nもしもメモが読めたとしたらと思うと\r\n気が気じゃなくて――\r\nどうかどうか、お願いします――！"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 544744,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 2606,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Finbar",
      "Jp" : "フィンバー"
    }
  }, {
